## Title: Thanks for the Buff (TFTB)
## Notes: Auto thank players who buff you with an emote or whisper, greet friends and guildmates with a wave as you pass them, and thank anyone you target with one click of your Thank You macros.
## Author: Gogo1951

## IconTexture: Interface/AddOns/TFTB/Includes/Images/Thanks-for-the-Buff.tga
